  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The power of your kiai leaves your opponents reeling.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Stunning Shout<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using an Improved (or Greater or Mighty) Kiai, you need spend only one use of Stunning Fist per target in the area that you wish to attempt to stun (including alternate effects allowed to monks from their stunning fist class feature). If creatures you target are non-mythic, you add one-half your mythic tier to the save DC of your Stunning Fist.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc105\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
